From 44f080a67500eda70ebe314f725451ad6f575703 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ruslan Bay <67730802+ruslanbay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 12:49:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] media: ipu6: Add IPU4P ISYS firmware operations

Implement IPU4P ISYS firmware messaging and queue operations using
the IPU4P firmware wire ABI and DMEM-based SysCom transport.
---
 drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu6/ipu4p-fw-isys.c | 487 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 487 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu6/ipu4p-fw-isys.c

diff --git a/drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu6/ipu4p-fw-isys.c b/drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu6/ipu4p-fw-isys.c
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..a3a1c8f34
--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu6/ipu4p-fw-isys.c
@@ -0,0 +1,487 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
+/*
